15. Conclusion
The Temperature Sensor Interfacing System using the 8051 microcontroller demonstrates temperature measurement and monitoring using a temperature sensor. It combines ADC interfacing, LCD interfacing, and Embedded C programming to measure and display temperature readings.
The project provides practical experience in microcontroller programming, sensor interfacing, and embedded-system development through software simulation.
